  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/IMG_4328.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Este fin de semana han finalizado los actos del Mes del Voluntariado en Onda, con el curso Desata tu alegr&iacute;a, potencia tu felicidad, el estreno de Lorcuras, a cargo de Arteatre y a beneficio de Caritas, y el Showlidario para recaudar alimentos y productos higi&eacute;nicos para Quisqueya.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalmesvoluntariat13/img_3945.jpg\" alt=\"img_3945\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalmesvoluntariat13/img_3946.jpg\" alt=\"img_3946\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalmesvoluntariat13/img_3947.jpg\" alt=\"img_3947\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalmesvoluntariat13/img_3948.jpg\" alt=\"img_3948\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalmesvoluntariat13/img_3949.jpg\" alt=\"img_3949\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalmesvoluntariat13/img_3950.jpg\" alt=\"img_3950\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalmesvoluntariat13/img_3951.jpg\" alt=\"img_3951\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalmesvoluntariat13/img_3952.jpg\" alt=\"img_3952\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalmesvoluntariat13/img_3953.jpg\" alt=\"img_3953\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4